  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FOOD SECURITY AND PERFORMANCE IMPROVEMENT PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Phoku High School Sustainable Food and Biogas Project in Botha-Bothe, Lesotho, aims to improve learner nutrition and educational performance through climate-smart agriculture. The objective of the grant is to enhance food security and environmental sustainability for vulnerable students and their community. Key activities include constructing a school kitchen, implementing a biogas digester, and establishing an organic garden.</narrative>
  </description>
